OL,3,GNEWSAThe film about fencing set between
OL,4,Atwo cultures                           
OL,6,FIt was Hollywood more than Bollywood   
OL,7,Fthat British Indian filmmaker Parvinder
OL,8,FShergill grew up on, with Karate Kid,  
OL,9,FRocky, A Few Good Men and ET among her 
OL,10,Ffavourite films.                       
OL,12,FThe actor, writer and producer, who    
OL,13,Flives in Berkshire, says she feels     
OL,14,F"really lucky" that she comes from "two
OL,15,Fworlds".                               
OL,17,FShergill says she builds stories around
OL,18,Fboth cultures, the latest of which are 
OL,19,Fher new film Touche and her first play 
OL,20,FThreads of Healing.                    
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
